msgid "Standalone native commands"
msgstr "独立执行原生命令"

msgid ""
"Use run_command() for small preparation scripts that need MEGAlib's initialized environment but "
"do not need an analysis workspace. It reuses MEGAlibRuntime's child-process initialization, so "
"the calling shell and Python environment do not need to source MEGAlib first."
msgstr ""
"小型准备脚本需要 MEGAlib 环境但无需分析工作区时，可使用 run_command()。它复用 MEGAlibRuntime 的子进程初始化机制，调用方的 shell 和 Python "
"无需提前 source MEGAlib 环境。"

msgid ""
"The return value is subprocess.CompletedProcess, not ExecutionResult. There is no root manifest, "
"execution ID, analysis group, input snapshot, product discovery or automatic output numbering. "
"Caller-selected files are written according to native command behavior. Temporary launch helpers "
"are removed even on failure or timeout. runtime.archive_inputs has no effect here."
msgstr ""
"返回值为 subprocess.CompletedProcess。它不创建 ExecutionResult、根 manifest、execution "
"ID、分析组、输入快照、产物发现或自动输出编号。文件按原生命令的行为写入。即使失败或超时也会删除临时启动文件。runtime.archive_inputs 在此无效。"

msgid "One random background interval"
msgstr "随机抽取一个背景片段"

msgid ""
"The following single-use example extracts a one-second interval from an input TRA. It creates "
"only the caller's output directory and the native output; no megalibpy workspace is required. "
"Supply the real valid time range in the TRA's native time system. The illustrative range is "
"assumed continuously valid."
msgstr "下例从输入 TRA 抽取一秒片段，只创建调用者指定的输出目录和原生产物，无需建立 megalibpy workspace。请提供 TRA 原生时间系统中真实有效的范围；示例假设该范围连续有效。"

msgid ""
"All other native cfg selections still apply. Native Mimrec's TimeMode=1 uses inclusive minimum "
"and maximum timestamps; this example does not introduce a half-open partitioning rule, infer "
"observation gaps or align event clocks. Use the generated TRA path as external_components in your"
" later named Mimrec analysis. Keep background selection and its study-specific bookkeeping in "
"your own script."
msgstr ""
"原生 cfg 中的其他筛选仍然生效。Mimrec 的 TimeMode=1 包含上下界时间戳；示例不引入左闭右开的分片规则，也不推断观测空隙或对齐事件时钟。之后可把生成的 TRA 路径作为命名 "
"Mimrec 分析的 external_components。背景选择和研究特有的记录请保留在自己的脚本中。"

msgid "Arguments, output and failures"
msgstr "参数、输出与失败处理"

msgid ""
"Pass an argv list, never a shell command string. Arguments are literal; shell expansion, pipes "
"and redirection operators are not interpreted. The optional cwd controls the child's working "
"directory; parent cwd/environment stay intact."
msgstr "传入 argv 列表，不要传 shell 命令字符串。参数按字面传递，不进行 shell 展开，也不解释管道或重定向。可选 cwd 控制子进程工作目录，父进程的 cwd 和环境保持不变。"

msgid ""
"By default stdout/stderr are inherited, without collecting whole logs in memory. With "
"capture_output=True both streams, including initialization output, are returned as UTF-8 strings "
"with invalid bytes replaced. Capture is unbounded; choose it only for appropriate output volumes."
msgstr ""
"默认继承 stdout/stderr，不把完整日志收集到内存。capture_output=True 时，两路输出（包括初始化输出）作为 UTF-8 "
"字符串返回，无效字节替换为占位字符。捕获没有大小上限，应根据输出量选择。"

msgid ""
"check=True is the default and raises subprocess.CalledProcessError for a nonzero exit, including "
"setup failure. check=False returns the exit status instead. timeout is in seconds, default None "
"(unlimited); expiration raises subprocess.TimeoutExpired following subprocess.run() termination "
"behavior. Neither exception has a workspace manifest. A zero exit status only reports the native "
"process result; the helper does not validate output contents."
msgstr ""
"默认 check=True，非零退出（包括环境初始化失败）会抛出 subprocess.CalledProcessError；check=False 则返回退出码。timeout 单位为秒，默认"
" None（不限时）；超时按 subprocess.run() 的终止行为抛出 subprocess.TimeoutExpired。这些异常不附带工作区 "
"manifest。零退出码只代表原生进程返回成功，函数不检查输出内容。"

msgid ""
"See :func:`megalibpy.run_command` for the full API. Use Cosima/Revan/Mimrec when managed "
"execution records and data lineage are required."
msgstr "完整 API 见 :func:`megalibpy.run_command`。需要受管理的执行记录和数据来源链路时，使用 Cosima/Revan/Mimrec。"
